CCR / WATER QUALITY REPORT PUBLISHING - READ ME
================================================
Owner: Elena Brooks, Water Quality Manager (x4402)
Last updated: 2026-06-24

Anything saved in this folder is picked up automatically by the public
website (www.{{ ww_domain }}/reports). The web server mounts this share
read-only using the CCR sync service account and refreshes the report list
every night. You do NOT need to email files to IT anymore.

Rules
  1. Final, Board-approved versions only. Drafts stay on your desktop or in
     the WQ team folder - not here.
  2. File name format:  <YEAR>_Annual_Water_Quality_Report_CCR.<ext>
  3. Member towns (Cedar Ridge, Millbrook, Ashby, Harlan Twp) receive their
     consecutive-system data packages by email from WQ by April 1. The
     wholesale report in this folder must be online by June 30 (state
     certification deadline is October 1).
  4. Do not put lab bench sheets, sample site addresses, or anything from
     the SCADA system in this folder - it is public.

Questions about the sync -> IT helpdesk, x4100 / helpdesk@{{ ww_domain }}
